    "title": "E Bikes Victoria: Buying Guide for Melbourne and Regional Riders",
    "excerpt": "A buying guide to e bikes Victoria riders can order online: cruisers, fat tyre trail bikes and kids bikes with real prices, ranges and warranty terms.",
