    "title": "150cc Dirt Bike vs Electric: Which Electric Dirt Bike Is the Equivalent?",
    "excerpt": "Comparing a 150cc dirt bike with electric? Convert kW to horsepower and see four mid-size electric bikes with real prices, weights, ranges and top speeds.",
