    "slug": "motorcycle-dirt-bike-for-sale-australia-electric",
    "title": "Motorcycle Dirt Bike for Sale in Australia: Electric Options by Budget",
    "excerpt": "Searching for a motorcycle dirt bike for sale in Australia? Compare four electric options by budget, with a price ladder, pre-purchase checklist and delivery info.",
