    "slug": "electric-fat-bike-guide-australia",
    "title": "Electric Fat Tyre Bike Australia: Wide-Tyre E-Bikes for Beach and Bush",
    "excerpt": "An electric fat tyre bike floats over sand, gravel and bush. Compare four wide-tyre e-bikes in Australia by battery, range, brakes and price from $2,590.",
