    "slug": "electric-scrambler-bike-australia",
    "title": "Electric Scrambler Bike Australia: Super73 Street and Trail Bikes Compared",
    "excerpt": "An electric scrambler bike blends motorbike looks with e-bike convenience. Compare the Super73-RX Mojave, Super73-S2 Adventure and ACE-X Demon S5 by price and specs.",
    "category": "Buyers Guide",
    "date": "2026-10-27",
