    "slug": "road-legal-electric-bike-australia-guide",
    "title": "Road Legal Electric Bike Australia: Road-Compliant E-Bikes and Mopeds",
    "excerpt": "Find a road legal electric bike in Australia: road-compliant Ampd e-bikes and road-registered mopeds compared by price, power, range and what each setup allows.",
